&lt;td colspan=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notes:&lt;/strong&gt; As the whole town was deemed infected, an order to eliminate all individuals in █████████ was executed. Civilian elimination caused severe moral drop in strike teams, non-strike team approach recommended in further suppression. Additionally, strike teams #1261 “Smoking Barrel,” #1084 “Road Rabbit,” and #1998 “Persuaders” were found to be infected by threat entity and eliminated. Threat entity has spread to surrounding towns. Further isolation and repression techniques required for effective elimination.&lt;/td&gt;
