&lt;td colspan=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notes:&lt;/strong&gt; Surrounding towns of ████████ and █████████ effectively eliminated. Stealth capabilities of the missiles proved effective: no destructive force or noticeable sound left the 3&amp;#160;km² bombing zones. Areas to be cordoned off from outsiders, with cover story immediately implemented.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
