hello yes this is kybard. i am writer who is definitely not a dog. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kybard.com&quot;&gt;i live inside of the internet.&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alright that&#039;s enough of that. Here are some &lt;strong&gt;SCPs&lt;/strong&gt; I wrote:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tabview-4446587b478ffc97893c4a3f2419cc03&quot; class=&quot;yui-navset&quot;&gt;
