&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:200%;&quot;&gt;Get it outlet because I&#039;m plugging?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;hahah I&#039;ll see myself out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;oh wait no I won&#039;t, this is &lt;strong&gt;MY&lt;/strong&gt; author page. So what have I written? A bunch of stuff of questionable quality.&lt;/p&gt;
