&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:red&quot;&gt;[K]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4255&quot;&gt;SCP-4255&lt;/a&gt; - Santa Claus, the Time Traveler&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I hope some crazy government shoots me out of the sky so I can get this hell over with.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Commentary&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Commentary&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commentary:&lt;/strong&gt; My first SCP posted. I still have a soft spot for it, and am still a bit surprised that this dorky idea about Santa Claus being a time traveling prisoner of the Foundation &lt;em&gt;actually worked out&lt;/em&gt;. I mean I&#039;m not complaining. I really want to make an image for this, but I am to lazy to do that at the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fun Fact:&lt;/strong&gt; The original draft had Santa get killed by the Global Occult Coalition launching a missile at him. This however, was pretty dumb.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:red&quot;&gt;[K]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4157&quot;&gt;SCP-4157&lt;/a&gt; - WANT DOG&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Jesus is my favorite snake width too!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
